EVALUATION.md §1, CODEGEN.md §4.1, §5.13 (gen/cpp refuseUnion): a types-mode emit holds no literal union over a ref into a table either.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A colour.
record Colour {
  /// Its name.
  name: String
}

/// The colours.
let colours: table Colour = {
  red { name: "Red" }
}

/// A pick.
record Pick {
  /// A colour, or auto.
  c: ref colours | "auto"
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/ac", namespace: "a", mode: types }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8019]  a/a.canon:17:3
  emit cpp in types mode cannot generate a literal union over a ref

